WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Spacefast Time Machine
Every version. Within reach.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.844
01 Compare any two versions
Two real deployments of the same site, side by side: v2 meets v1.

00:00:07.844 --> 00:00:11.344
01 Pick a version from history
Selecting v1 flips the view: v1 meets v2, with live v2 alongside.

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:16.994
02 Check any screen size
v1's viewport narrows 700px in seven keyboard steps, then resets.

00:00:16.994 --> 00:00:22.394
03 See what changed
A real unified diff of the served files, v2 to v1.

00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:25.444
03 Before / after
The same file change, side by side.

00:00:25.444 --> 00:00:29.994
04 Share the exact comparison
The link reopens these exact versions in this same view.

00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:35.154
05 Restore, with safeguards
Public demo – restore disabled. Connected accounts: typed confirmation, provider approval when required, then live verification.

00:00:35.154 --> 00:00:39.466
Try the live demo: space-xx8uckgsp.space.fast/?demo=1
